# Stencil placement: mouse click, then keyboard (arrows + Space/Enter)
size 120 40
spawn
wait "Welcome" 10s
keys esc
keys n
wait "Stencils"
type double box
keys enter
wait "click or Space to stamp"
click 5 3
keys right right right right right right right right right right right right right right right right right right right right
keys space
keys down down down down down down down
keys enter
keys esc
wait idle
expect "done stamping"
shot stencils_placed
